# klib-pins - the pinned k-lib versions, in ONE place.
#
# The k-libs are the foundation layer (gitlab.com/kzangeli, public, Apache 2.0).
# They are pinned to release branches: the combination below is the one the
# whole stack is known to build and pass its suite with.
#
# Everything that assembles the stack reads THIS file - bootstrap.sh and the
# broker's docker/Dockerfile both did so by restating the list, which is how
# two copies of a version pin end up disagreeing at the worst moment.
#
# Format: <repo> <ref>, one per line. Blank lines and #-comments ignored.
#
kbase   release/0.10
kalloc  release/0.10.1
klog    release/0.10
khash   release/0.10
kjson   release/0.13.0
kargs   release/0.10
ktrace  release/0.10
kprom   release/0.1.0
